-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",339,{
[10817]="70041181\n1\tOrders can be found through the main Corsair encampment in Tarlang's Crown. Harnion has asked you to seek out orders from Azruthor in an effort to learn more of the Heirs' plan in Tarlang's Crown.\t\n2\tSearch for any further communication between Azruthor and the Scourge\tA missive to Azruthor can likely be found in the largest tent in the Corsair encampment in Tarlang's Crown. You have found numerous plans for the Corsairs amidst their camp, and should now search for any missives to Azruthor himself.\n",
[10818]="70062132\n1\tFind Dunlendings near Nímbarth\tRiderch has asked you to look for his fellow scouts near Nímbarth. Nímbarth is located north-east of Stonecrop Encampment.\n2\tTalk to Meriona\tYou have found the Dunlendings near Nímbarth. You should talk to their leader, Meriona.\n",
[10819]="7000808D\n1\tDefeat the Blogmal Defiler\tThe Blogmal Defiler can be found in the ruins of Fornost City, east of the treasure hunters' camp. In order to end the corruption of the local wildlife, Reynold Potts has asked you to kill the Blogmal Defiler.\n2\tReturn to Reynold Potts\tReynold Potts is at the treasure hunters' camp in Fornost. Potts will be relieved to know that the Blogmal Defiler met his end at your hands, removing the threat of his corrupting influence.\n",
[10820]="70018E15\n1\tBring the delivery ledgers to Torfi\030Collect delivery ledgers (total: 8)\tThe entrance to Sejer-tharâkh lies within Mezer-serej. Torfi has asked that you enter Sejer-tharâkh and search for any ancient ledgers remaining within the store-house.\n",
[10821]="70018E14\n1\tDefeat leader of the intruders within Sejer-tharâkh\tThe entrance to Sejer-tharâkh lies within Mezer-serej. Torfi has asked you to defeat the leader of the intruders within Sejer-tharâkh.\n2\tTalk to Torfi at Mezer-serej\tTorfi is at Mezer-serej. With the defeat of their leader, the intruders within Sejer-tharâkh have had their morale weakened. You should return to Torfi and tell him of your victory.\n",
[10822]="70018E16\n1\tDefeat intruders in Sejer-tharâkh (total: 20)\tThe entrance to Sejer-tharâkh lies within Mezer-serej. Torfi has asked you to assist him in clearing Sejer-tharâkh of the intruders within.\n2\tTalk to Torfi at Mezer-serej\tTorfi can be found at Mezer-serej in the eastern halls of Zelem-melek. You should return to Torfi to receive a reward for your efforts.\n",
[10823]="70024FE0\n1\tFind out what the mayor wants from you\tThe mayor stands in the centre of Winter-home, overseeing the events of the Yule Festival. You should speak with the mayor and find out what he wants from you, though it sounds like he has a sleazy scheme brewing.\n2\tTell Gareth Rust of the Mayor's desire to expose him\tGareth Rust is in the workers' area in Winter-home, ever toiling. You should tell Gareth Rust that the mayor wants you to spy on him so he will lose his job.\n3\tInvestigate the fort in Frostbluff where the mayor stores his funds and records\tThe fort on the frozen lake is east of Winter-home in Frostbluff. You should go to the fort on the frozen lake and find what evidence you can of the Mayor's corruption, as Gareth Rust is sure the town's money is being put to corrupt use.\n4\tDefend yourself from the banker of Frostbluff\030Use the door to gain access to the store-house\tThe fort on the frozen lake is east of Winter-home in Frostbluff. You should go to the fort on the frozen lake and find what evidence you can of the Mayor's corruption, as Gareth Rust is sure the town's money is being put to corrupt use.\n5\tExamine the piece of paper dropped by the banker\tA piece of paper has swirled into your hand as the banker of Frostbluff fled from his post. You should examine this piece of paper.\n6\tBring the proof of the mayor's corruption to Mayor Goodnough\tThe mayor is in the town of Winter-home, in Frostbluff. You should return to the mayor with the evidence you collected of his corruption.\n7\tTell Barrett Nowell that he may have his old job back\030Tell Ted Ives that he may have his old job back\030Tell Regina Judson that she may have her old job back\030Tell Jack Judson that he may have his old job back\030Tell Bill Hyde that he may have his old job back\tThe beggars, now re-hired for the former positions, are around the town. You should quickly tell the beggars that their period of despair is at an end at last.\n8\tTalk to Gareth Rust of all that you have achieved on behalf of the workers\tGareth Rust and Daley Utteridge are in the workers' area in Winter-home. You should tell the workers of your success in manipulating the mayor. Things are looking up for the workers of Winter-home!\n",
[10824]="7006AA0A\n1\tCollect Númenórean relics (total: 8)\tPorókho believes Númenórean relics may be found in the eastern part of Ilmabiri, beneath the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl. You should go there and collect them.\n2\tTalk to Porókho\tYou have collected Númenórean relics found in the sewers. You should bring them to Porókho at Hêbatokh, his camp in Ilmabiri.\n",
[10825]="7002BFE6\n1\tTalk to Céola at Etheburg in the Brown Lands\tCéola is at Etheburg in the Brown Lands, south of Helstor. You shoud bring the note you found to Céola at once, for it implicates one of his men as a traitor.\n",
[10826]="70015467\n1\tCollect dwarf-letters (total: 4)\tLetters can be taken from merrevail looting the bodies of fallen dwarves in the halls of Durin's Way. Listein has asked you to reclaim dwarf-letters before they are be taken away by merrevail.\n2\tTalk to Listein at the Door to the Clouds\tListein as at the Door to the Clouds, near the entrance to Zirakzigil. You should bring the dwarf-letters back to Listein.\n",
[10827]="7001E9C0\n1\tDefeat Ukhurk\030Destroy Ukhurk's battle-standard\tUkhurk and his standard can be found in Garmadh-maudhûl to the north-east of Mithechad. Eirien has asked you to defeat Ukhurk, leader of the Orcs at Garmadh-maudhûl and cast down his standard.\n2\tTalk to Eirien at Mithechad\tEirien is at Mithechad, south-west of Garmadh-maudhûl. You should return to Eirien and let her know that Ukhurk has been defeated and his standard destroyed.\n",
[10828]="70019031\n1\tDefeat Narshpug or Grakâmâb before they leave the field, and still win the battle.\tRilhathel has asked you to not only successfully win the battle for Lórien, but to also defeat Narshpug or Grakâmâb before they leave the field of battle.\n2\tSuccessfully complete the Battle of Lórien\tRilhathel has asked you to not only successfully win the battle for Lórien, but to also defeat Narshpug or Grakâmâb before they leave the field of battle. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tTalk to Rilhathel at Caras Galadhon\tRilhathel is at Caras Galadhon, waiting to hear if you successfully completed his challenge.\n",
[10829]="70019032\n1\tPrevent Belvagor from receiving any serious damage and still win the battle.\tRilhathel has asked you to not only successfully win the battle for Lórien, but to also prevent Belvagor from sustaining any serious wounds.\n2\tSuccessfully complete the Battle of Lórien\tRilhathel has asked you to not only successfully win the battle for Lórien, but to also prevent Belvagor from sustaining any serious wounds. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tTalk to Rilhathel at Caras Galadhon\tRilhathel is at Caras Galadhon, waiting to hear if you successfully completed his challenge.\n",
[10830]="70019033\n1\tWin the Battle of Lórien in under thirty minutes\tRilhathel has asked you to not only successfully win the battle for Lórien, but to do it quickly: within thirty minutes!\n2\tSuccessfully complete the Battle of Lórien within thirty minutes\tRilhathel has asked you to not only successfully win the battle for Lórien, but to do it quickly: within thirty minutes! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tTalk to Rilhathel at Caras Galadhon\tRilhathel is at Caras Galadhon, waiting to hear if you successfully completed his challenge.\n",
[10831]="7003A472\n1\tDefeat Warg-rider sentries (0/8)\tThere are many Warg-rider sentries riding around Madh-fushaum alert for threats or victims. You should defeat as many of them as possible.\n2\tDefeat Warg-rider sentries (total: 8)\tThere are many Warg-rider sentries riding around Madh-fushaum alert for threats or victims. You should defeat as many of them as possible.\n3\tCompleted\tYou managed to defeat the Warg-rider sentries without the force within Madh-fushaum being alerted to your presence.\n",
[10832]="70035742\n1\tDefeat Balewood sentries (total: 8)\tBalewood sentries can be found outside Drû Vádokan in north-west Balewood. Scouts of the White Hand patrol the forest and seek to silence any that stand against their master's vile designs. They must be defeated if the Balewood is to be reclaimed.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have slain many scouts of the White Hand and paved a way for a greater assault into Drû Vádokan.\n",
[10833]="7001D0D8\n1\tSearch Cargûl sentries for clues\tWatching stones and their Cargûl sentries can be found throughout Gathbúrz. Handelen has asked you to defeat a number of the Cargûl sentries found near the watching stones in Gathbúrz to learn if a way might be found to protect the Malledhrim from the effects of the stones.\n2\tSearch Cargûl sentries for clues\tWatching stones and their Cargûl sentries can be found throughout Gathbúrz. Handelen has asked you to defeat a number of the Cargûl sentries found near the watching stones in Gathbúrz to learn if a way might be found to protect the Malledhrim from the effects of the stones.\n3\tTalk to Handelen in Thangúlhad\tHandelen is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz. You should bring the engraved dagger you found to Handelen.\n4\tBring the engraved dagger to Agorin\tAgorin is at Ost Galadh in Emyn Lûm, west of Thangúlhad. Handelen instructed you to bring the engraved dagger you found to Agorin, the Malledhrim Lore-master in Emyn Lûm.\n5\tTalk to Handelen at Thangúlhad\tHandelen is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz. You should return to Handelen and tell him what you have learned from Agorin about the Watchers of Dol Guldur.\n",
[10834]="70028457\n1\tDefeat White Hand sentries (total: 8)\tWhite Hand sentries can be found near the Pillar of the Hand, not far from Dagoras' camp. Dagoras has asked you to defeat several of the sentries guarding the southern end of Nan Curunír.\n2\tTalk to Dagoras at his camp in Nan Curunír\tDagoras is at his camp in Nan Curunír. You should tell Dagoras that many of the White Hand sentries have been driven off.\n",
[10835]="70008750\n1\tReturn the patches to Chieftain Durulkum at Dâr-gazag\030Collect sergeants' patches (total: 10)\tSergeant-at-Arms lead small numbers of Men, Elves and dwarves throughout the Ettenmoors. Chieftain Durulkum directed you to obtain sergeants' patches before returning to him at Dâr-gazag.\n",
[10836]="700431BC\n1\tTalk to Othor\tOthor can be found at Minlos in eastern Upper Lebennin. Othor has asked for your aid in defending Arnach from the Haradrim. You should speak to him when you are ready. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Othor\tOthor can be found at Minlos in eastern Upper Lebennin. You have successfully defended Arnach from attack and should now speak to Othor.\n3\tTalk to Lady Terenis\tLady Terenis can be found in her hall in Tumladen. Othor has asked you to return to Lady Terenis and warn her of the Haradrim forces readying to cross into Lossarnach.\n",
[10837]="700166E6\n1\tDefeat the White Hand lieutenant\tThe White-hand Lieutenant can be found in Gazatmur, north-east of the Dolven-view. You should defeat the White-hand Lieutenant.\n2\tTell Wigfast of the White Hand presence\tWigfast is at his hiding spot near the entry-way of Gazatmur. You should seek out Wigfast and tell him of the White Hand corruption you discovered and quelled in one swoop.\n",
[10838]="70028454\n1\tDefeat Apprentices of Saruman (total: 6)\tSaruman's apprentices can be found in Isengard. Dagoras has asked to you to hunt down any of Saruman's apprentices that you come across in Isengard.\n2\tTalk to Dagoras within the Ring of Isengard\tDagoras is within the Ring of Isengard. You should return to Dagoras with news of your success.\n",
[10839]="70037080\n1\tTalk to Cenulf in Oserley\tCenulf may be found near the mill in Oserley. Thane Ordlac asked you to speak with Cenulf and obtain his guidance during your investigation of the brigands' note.\n2\tDefeat mounted half-orc archers near Oserley (total: 6)\tMounted half-orc archers can be found throughout the fields west of Oserley. Cenulf asked you to defeat mounted half-orc archers to discover more evidence of the traitor in Oserley.\n3\tTalk to Cenulf in Oserley\tCenulf is near the mill in Oserley. You should return to Cenulf with news of your victories against the half-orcs.\n",
[10840]="70049621\n1\tDefeat Urudanî's Ghâsh-hai followers and Flame-spirits in Naerband\tNaerband is located in Talath Úrui. You should defeat Urudanî's Ghâsh-hai followers and Flame-spirits within Naerband.\n2\tDefeat Urudanî's Warriors (total: 4)\030Defeat Flame-spirits (total: 8)\tNaerband is located in Talath Úrui. You should defeat Urudanî's Warriors and Flame-spirits within Naerband.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeated Urudanî's Warriors and Flame-spirits in Naerband.\n",
[10841]="70058FED\n1\tCaptured Longbeards can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. Múta has discovered several Longbeards held captive in Tûr Ágal. You should free them.\t\n2\tTalk to Múta\tMúta can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. You have freed all of the captured Longbeards that you could find. You should return to Múta.\n",
[10842]="70058CF8\n1\tDefeat servants of the Iron Crown in Caivád Sâr and Tûr Ágal (total: 14)\tServants of the Iron Crown can be found in Caivád Sâr and Tûr Ágal. You have discovered a settlement of wicked Angmarim still loyal to the Iron Crown at Caivád Sâr. You should defeat the Angmarim of the Iron Crown dwelling in Caivád Sâr, and its tower, Tûr Ágal.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many of the wicked servants of the Iron Crown dwelling in Caivád Sâr, and its tower, Tûr Ágal.\n",
[10843]="7002280F\n1\tDefeat Cun Annun (total: 10)\tCun Annun can be found in the southern reaches of the Lichbluffs. Mincham has asked you to find and defeat as many Cun Annun as you are able.\n2\tTalk to Mincham in the Lich Bluffs\tMincham's camp is south and slightly east of the large Gondorian ruins in the Lich Bluffs. You should return to Mincham and let him know that you have located and dispatched a pack of Cun Annun.\n",
[10844]="70027214\n1\tDefeat goblins at Naur-maudhûl (total: 10)\tAmlan is at his camp beneath the eaves of the Gravenwood. Gwilum asked you to speak with Amlan regarding your successes at Naur-maudhûl.\n",
[10845]="70036FDA\n1\tTalk to Grimmar in the Mead Hall of Stoke\tGrimmar is in the Mead Hall of Stoke. Fríthild told you to speak with Grimmar and obtain the signets with which to summon the Thanes of the Broadacres.\n2\tGain entrance to the Mead Hall of Oserley\tOserley lies along the road north-east from Stoke. Fríthild has asked you to deliver a signet to Ordlac of Oserley, summoning him to her aid.\n3\tBring the signet of Oserley to Ordlac\tThane Ordlac is within the Mead Hall of Oserley. Éoric afforded you access to the Mead Hall of Oserley to speak with Thane Ordlac.\n",
[10846]="7003715A\n1\tTorsbury lies to the west of Oserley, near the border of the Stonedeans. Ordlac bade you hurry by the straightest route to Torsbury to aid Tordag and bring him Fríthild's summons.\t\n2\tBring the signet of Torsbury to Thane Tordag\tTordag is at his encampment just north of the road between Torsbury and Stoke. Fríthild sent you to bring the signet of Torsbury to Tordag, summoning him to Stoke's aid.\n",
[10847]="7002D610\n1\tFind the horse in Ost Guruth\tA horse in Ost Guruth is seeking an audience with you.\n2\tJourney into the Trollshaws and find a horse in Thorenhad.\t\n3\tTalk to Roheryn at the Rivendell stables\tRoheryn is found at the stables in Rivendell.\n",
[10848]="7002D5F9\n1\tFind a Ranger's horse in Esteldín\tYou are drawn to Esteldín by a notion of some conflict there, and you feel connected to that purpose somehow. You seek a horse that can inform you about the tactics and strategies of war as a steed. If defeated or time expires, you will return to Hengstacer Farm.\n2\tDefeat Ongbúrz horse-trappers (total: 3)\tTerrible horse-traps are being used by the enemy and can be found in the passes toward Dol Dínen. If defeated or time expires, you will return to Hengstacer Farm.\n3\tTalk to the Ranger's horse at Esteldín\tThe Ranger's horse can be found back in Esteldín. If defeated or time expires, you will return to Hengstacer Farm.\n",
})
